Cell["\<\
There are several ways that you can describe the geo locations in your data. \
You can specify data using coordinates, with a geo entity or as a position \
relative to either of these.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5fb2ea91-a0c3-408e-8b19-ee779ea3bf0d"],

